            "reviewBody": "This is amazing! I used the Better than Boullion and oh my gosh, I can’t tell you how good this is! No more MSG! Simple and delicious, thank you Sarah Jo for letting me know how much Better than Boullion to use! And of course, Daisy Sour Cream is the best!! WOW! Never buying the expensive packaged dip mix again!",
